n removed before going down." "Even the poorest house with one room, stable, and thatch roof had a loft for the storage of faggots, straw, unthreshed grain, baskets of grain and miscellaneous articles, sometimes piles of grain and other foods."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 888, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 792})
